 "intro": {
  "text": "The Queen's Gambit offers the c-pawn to win control of the centre. In this line Black accepts with 2...dxc4, but holding the pawn is impractical: Black has given up control of e4, and White develops calmly, regains the pawn and keeps the bigger share of the centre.",
